      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Description:\r\nSituated in a prime location within the sought-after family friendly Greenpark Estate, this bright and spacious 3/4 bedroom semi-detached residence is presented to the open market in excellent condition throughout. This generous family home benefits from off-street parking to the front and a large private rear garden. \r\n\r\nThe property extends to 161m2 and has the benefit of oil-fired central heating, inset stove, PVC double-glazed windows and doors, and ample parking. \r\n\r\nGreenpark is located on the western side of Mullingar town, within easy access of the N4 motorway. Primary and secondary schools, shopping facilities, social amenities, and GAA ground are all within walking distance, making this a highly convenient location. \r\n\r\nThis well-presented home enjoys a pleasant position overlooking a large green area to the front, with excellent access to local amenities and outdoor spaces. The property is just a short walk from the canal line and greenway, offering convenient access to scenic walking and cycling routes. \r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation provides well-proportioned living space, including a large kitchen/diner with a multi-fuel stove, a separate utility room with useful storage, and a convenient downstairs WC.  Upstairs, the master bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while all bedrooms feature built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage throughout. A large hot press adds further valuable storage space.  The property also benefits from a composite front door, a generous driveway and an attractive front aspect overlooking the green.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\tOFCH\t\t\t\t\t\t\t                -\tInset solid fuel stove\r\n\tLarge private back garden\t\t\t\t        -\tPVC windows and doors\r\n\tClose to N4 motorway\t\t\t\t\t        -\tClose to Mullingar town\r\n\tPrime location\t\t\t\t\t\t                -\tClose to local schools, Church & GAA\r\n\tOverlooking a large green area to the front\t\t\tgrounds\r\n\tComposite front door\t\t\t\t\t        -\tShort walk to the canal line and greenway,\r\n\tMaster bedroom with ensuite\t\t\t\t\t         ideal for walking and cycling\r\n\tBuilt-in wardrobes in all bedrooms\t\t\t        -\tLarge hot press providing excellent storage\r\n\tSpacious kitchen/diner with multi-fuel stove\t\t-\tSeparate utility room with additional storage\r\n\tDownstairs WC                                                       -\tDetached brick built outhouse"
      },
